            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the stop\u2011time rule requires the government to serve a notice to appear that includes the date and time of the hearing; without those details the rule may not be triggered."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "362e695b0f41fbd8209dcbcb337c3c1aec8d7c2ec2609608e85059b2dae3b3e8",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-362e695b0f41-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 66,
              "start": 66
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Board of Immigration Appeals has held that there are no substantive requirements on a notice to appear to trigger the stop\u2011time rule."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
